","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":346,"closed_issues":2304,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T09:34:58Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-11-08T22:16:34Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T18:08:25Z","closed_at":"2026-09-17T18:03:50Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112562","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112562","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112562.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112562.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-17T18:03:49Z"},"body":"Godot core currently supports the following misleading syntaxes:\r\n\r\n```c++\r\nHashMap<X, Y> map = 2; // The hash map is set to 2? What does this mean?\r\n\r\nHashSet<int> set = 5; // Does the set start out with a 5 in it? Nope, that's the initial capacity.\r\n\r\nprint_line(set == 1); // Prints true, 1 is implicitly converted to HashSet for the comparison, which equals 'set' because both are empty.\r\n\r\nvoid function(const AHashMap &p_map) {}\r\n\r\nfunction(false); // Ah, we're disabling a flag? Nope, false is implicitly converted to 0, which is implicitly converted to AHashMap.\r\n```\r\n\r\nThese are obviously semantically problematic, which can lead to bugs. Making the constructors explicit alleviates the problem somewhat.\r\n\r\nAnother option would be to remove the constructors altogether, but that makes it a bit harder (e.g. `AStar`) to choose a different initial capacity than the default. So having the constructor in general is probably justified. (in the future, we might discuss using factory methods for this, but this is currently not a big part of our code style)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112562/reactions","total_count":9,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":4},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112562/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}